    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρδῐκ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>more than just, severely
				just,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νέμεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					10.44
				</span></i>
			; of things, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἂν ὑπέρδικ᾽
			ᾖ</span> though they be <i>never so just,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1119
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1396
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pleading for</i> another, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				86e
			</span></i>.</div>
